  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) = 254\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nx⁵ + (1)/(x⁵) = ( x³ + (1)/(x³) ) × ( x² + (1)/(x²) ) - (x + (1)/(x) )\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx⁴ + (1)/(x⁴) +2 = [{x² + (1)/(x²)}]²\n\n⇒ [{x² + (1)/(x²)}]² = 254 + 2\n\n⇒ [{x² + (1)/(x²)}] = 16\n\n⇒ ​x² + (1)/(x²) +2 = [{x + (1)/(x)}]² ​\n\n⇒ ​(x + (1)/(x) ) = √16+2\n\n⇒ ​(x + (1)/(x) ) = 3√2\n\n⇒ ​(x³ + (1)/(x³) ) = (3√2)³ - 3 × 3√2\n\n⇒ ​(x³ + (1)/(x³) ) = 54√2 - 9√2\n\n⇒ ​(x³ + (1)/(x³) ) = 45√2\n\n⇒x⁵ + (1)/(x⁵) = 45√2 × 16 - 3√2\n\n⇒ x⁵ + (1)/(x⁵) = 717√2\n\n142:T15e0,\n&",
